      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Rolls-Royce pull up, Black boy hop out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Shoutout to my mother, and my father didn't— (Hold up)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"Oh, my God, I never seen nothin' like this\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Haha, that's what my mom was sayin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "She, she was cryin' and shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It was, she was just like, \"This shit is beautiful\"",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "It was a beautiful moment",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You alway– you always keep the picnic blankets in the back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "'Cause you, you never know (Gangsta Grillz)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "You never know where the fuck you gon' end up at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "(Okay, haha, let's go, now we ready)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
