    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Niggas ain't really on the type of shit he on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I hit Drizzy and told him I had a milli' for him (Oh shit)",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I own my companies full, told 'em to keep the loan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I took that gold bitch home, niggas was big mad (Ugh, oh shit)",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I put that bitch on the shelf to let it ventilate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And bought another car 'cause I ain't know how to celebrate (Top shelf, nigga)",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That big boy, that big bitch for all weather",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "It never rain in Cali', came with an umbrella (Ooh)",
