        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Niggas can not fuck with performance of magic (Oh), new wand (Nigga)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "That's my nuance, used to be the weirdo (Ah)",
