          "text": "Used to treat me like that boy off Malcolm in the Middle  (Why I'm motherfuckin' rich)",
          "rhyme": "9dl",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Now I'm zero, zero, zero, zero, zero, zero (That's six)",
